        </div>
        <div class="dnf-field">
            <label class="dnf-field__label" for="select-disabled">Database</label>
            <select class="dnf-select" id="select-disabled" disabled>
                <option>PostgreSQL</option>
            </select>
        </div>
    </div>
</ui-doc-example>

<h3 id="asp-for">With asp-for</h3>
<p>Write the class next to <code>asp-for</code> and <code>asp-items</code>; a model error adds <code>input-validation-error</code>,
    drawn as invalid.</p>

<ui-doc-code id="asp-for-code" lang="razor">
<div class="dnf-field">
    <label class="dnf-field__label" asp-for="Status">Status</label>
    <select class="dnf-select" asp-for="Status" asp-items="Model.Statuses"></select>
    <span class="dnf-field__error" asp-validation-for="Status"></span>
</div>
</ui-doc-code>

<h2 id="customization">Customization</h2>
<p>The three <a href="@UiDocsCatalog.Root/customization">customization levels</a>, none needing <code>!important</code>. Level 1
    is the modifiers <code>--sm</code>, <code>--lg</code> and <code>--auto</code>.</p>

<ui-doc-example id="custom-tailwind" title="Tailwind utilities" description="A fixed width with a utility." layout="row">
    <select class="dnf-select w-48" aria-label="Language">
        <option>English</option>
        <option>Deutsch</option>
        <option>Français</option>
    </select>
</ui-doc-example>

<ui-doc-example id="custom-tokens" title="Component tokens" description="The control tokens of the input apply to the select too; --dnf-select-chevron-size sets the chevron." layout="block">
    <div class="dnf-docs-demo-controls dnf-field max-w-md">
        <label class="dnf-field__label" for="tokens-select">Layout</label>
        <select class="dnf-select" id="tokens-select">
            <option>Full width</option>
